WEBVTT

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:46.860
Haman Khan's attack has brought Grips 2 to a halt, and for the time being, it's been rendered non-functional.

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:51.130
For the moment, the lunar city of Granada appears to be out of danger.

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:56.700
But now, Haman is making arrangements to meet with Jamitav, the leader of the Titans.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:03.010
The Gate of Sedan.

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:29.020
Please, sir.

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:29.890
Thanks.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.180
She's a treacherous witch.

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:32.080
You think so?

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:34.000
And how could you have survived so far?

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:38.040
The best way to stay alive is to get your enemies before they get you.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:41.020
I'd imagine that Haman feels the same way.

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:47.530
I'll agree to meet her, and I'm fine with her request to make it a location outside of the gate of Zedan.

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:49.710
Sir, what's that?

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:53.020
A good luck charm for my own survival.

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:58.750
We don't know what tricks that woman might have up her sleeve if it becomes necessary.

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:03.390
Don't hesitate to use it, and keep the Dogos gear up to date.

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:04.010
Sir.

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:12.000
Need a hand with something?

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:14.300
Are you skipping another meal to help with maintenance?

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:16.000
You should go take a break.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:21.260
I've got to help out, otherwise people just forget about me around here.

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:22.480
Stop your sulking.

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:26.720
Camille, do me a favor and take this maintenance checklist to the bridge.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:27.180
Sure.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:28.540
Here, let me.

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:32.380
Have we received any word from Haman yet?

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:35.080
By now, she should be at the gate of Zedon.

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:38.650
What do you mean, any word from Haman?

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:42.150
Hmm, this does not concern you, Kotz.

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:44.370
Both of you practically bowed down to her.

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:46.110
How can you keep taking this?

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:50.690
And not only that, but I can't believe that both of you are still apparently working with her.

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:52.350
Now that's enough, Kotz.

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:55.120
This is why I was against it.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.180
We've joined forces with the Zobbies.

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:59.980
Thus far, there's no sign that Haman will be...

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.760
We could be the ones that she double-crosses next time.

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:08.680
That's possible, but for the time being, we simply have no choice but to trust her.

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:10.770
What a cop-out!

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:11.950
Cuts!

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:15.140
I don't want to hear your so-called grown-up excuses!

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:29.610
Rekwaland?

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:33.100
Ah, thanks for coming, Sarah.

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:36.470
But that's the Gwadon.

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:40.650
That's right. The Gwadon is entering the gate of Zedan's airspace.

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:44.890
They've come to demonstrate their everlasting friendship with the Titans.

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:47.610
Yeah, but...

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:51.530
Yes, of course. I don't trust someone as cunning as Haman is.

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:54.110
Rekoa feels the same way I do.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.190
Which brings me to why I called you here, Sarah.

00:04:57.680 --> 00:04:59.960
Do you intend to visit the gate of Zedan, Sarah?

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:03.610
Yes. Rekawa and I will be going.

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:06.900
Huh? What? Me too. I'll go with you too, sir.

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:10.740
No. Two of us will suffice for this particular trip.

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:13.480
But the Argama's in the vicinity and closing in.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:17.560
So I'd like you to cover us and watch for enemies. All right?

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:19.460
Yes, sir.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:23.400
It's because of my great trust in you.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:26.900
I'm leaving my safety in your hands. Do you understand?

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:29.450
If those are your orders...

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:31.350
Then I'll obey.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:47.980
Zabiyarov, launching.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:07.410
Master Paptimus made me jealous on purpose, to motivate me to fight so much better for him.

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:09.970
Chief Serra, when should we make our course change?

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:11.900
We'll continue straight for now.

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:14.070
But that'll put us right in front of the Argama.

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:16.560
We're going to provide a diversion.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:22.890
If you're telling me I'm not doing enough, Master Paptimus, then I'll show you.

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:33.580
Three Titan mobile suits straight ahead of us, ma'am.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:34.280
They're closing.

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:38.010
Tell them we're not coming any closer until they fall back.

00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:38.710
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:42.170
It's very important that you contact the Argama at the correct moment.

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:43.650
The timing has to be perfect.

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:44.190
Ma'am.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:45.950
Jamitav Hyman.

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:48.860
I can't wait to see his face.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:56.780
So you think we should give Kotz a regular position as a combat pilot?

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:57.360
Yes.

00:06:57.740 --> 00:06:59.880
I think he'll shape up if he's given greater response.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.800
All right, let me think about it.

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:03.990
That's strange.

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:05.320
What is it?

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:06.620
Well, it's that asteroid.

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:08.520
I'm picking up a faint signal.

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:11.620
Probably just an abandoned defense post.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:12.640
Oh, no!

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:15.340
Sir, mobile suit's approaching from straight ahead!

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:17.050
How many?

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:17.740
Three.

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:19.990
Are they Chiracos, people?

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:23.980
I can hear a voice.

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:24.950
Camille?

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:26.030
Camille?

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:26.950
Yes, sir?

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:28.340
Is something wrong?

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:29.000
No, sir.

00:07:29.730 --> 00:07:29.970
Get out of here.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.120
Out there in the Zeta.

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:31.660
Yes, sir.

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:37.420
Was he sensing pressure from the enemy?

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:40.280
Zeta Gundam, launching!

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:47.100
Someone's calling.

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:48.850
Is it one of them?

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:53.340
Here comes the Zeta now.

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:54.450
Is it Camille?

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:56.670
You two fan out and flank it.

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:57.150
Roger.

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:52.950
My mono-eye is it.

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:13.970
Is that Sarah?

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:15.480
Yes, Camille.

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:16.500
It's Sarah.

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:17.640
Just make me.

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:20.740
You'll destroy yourself, too, if you fire from that range.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:24.160
Why are you risking your life by charging at us so recklessly?

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:26.860
Master Paptimus will recognize my efforts.

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:29.060
That creep is just using you.

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:29.980
Can't you see that?

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.800
You wouldn't understand because you don't even know him.

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:43.820
Those three were decoys.

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:45.140
All mobile suits.

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:48.730
Get ready to launch and send cots out in the methis.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.270
Sir, don't you mean fa?

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:51.390
I said cots.

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:53.920
We're close to the gate of Zedan.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.980
Have the argum ahead for the enemy ships right in front of us.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.480
Let me guess. I'll be staying on the bridge.

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:09.080
Is she trying to lure me in there?

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:25.440
She must have gone deeper inside.

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:29.900
Sealed airlock.

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:48.630
that probably means it still has atmosphere that's right keep coming camille huh where's he going

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:09.350
taking all these risks for master paptimus sarah you've already done more than enough for that guy

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:15.560
if he really did care for you he wouldn't be sending you on such dangerous missions

00:11:15.560 --> 00:11:24.180
you're wrong he has greater plans for me than he does for rekoa rekoa that's right rekoa lawn

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:29.920
she's just motivating me stop it sarah face the facts he's

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:37.740
Nothing, but a con artist. He doesn't have any real feelings for you. Why can't you understand that you're the one who doesn't understand?

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:46.670
Master Paptimus will bring forth a new world for humanity. Even if it costs you your life

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:55.610
I'd gladly give up my life for his great vision you idiot when you lose your life. It's over when you're gone

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:44.600
We're terribly sorry that our clumsiness the other day has caused you so much inconvenience.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:47.480
The accident at Grips 2 was a result of my subordinate.

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:48.620
Spare me the details.

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:52.450
Tell me what you want with us and think carefully before you answer

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:55.050
because I may yet have the Guadon vaporized.

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:56.730
I wonder about that.

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:59.980
Do anything so unwise and Axis will destroy the gate of...

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.060
Zedan. The asteroid?

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:05.500
Yes. So what do you want?

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:07.530
The revival of the Zobbies.

00:13:08.360 --> 00:13:10.000
I've already promised you the

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.700
restoration of the Zobby family.

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:14.160
Must I seal this with my blood?

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:14.840
Blood?

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.140
What does a blood

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:21.740
smear on a piece of paper prove?

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:23.760
But I will tell you what I really want.

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:26.980
The only thing that will satisfy

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:28.020
me is your life.

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:32.710
Don't shoot her! Take her alive!

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:35.040
This earring is filled with cyanide gas.

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:37.500
One little squeeze and out it comes.

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:41.640
There's more than enough in here to kill every living person here in this chamber.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.420
You fiend!

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:47.820
I guess this decides it. Axis is going to ram the Gate of Zedan.

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.580
We won't let you get away with this!

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:54.030
Sorry to say, but it looks like everything is going according to plan.

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:56.360
Hurry, Mistress Haman!

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:59.940
Very well. I warned you.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:17.610
would happen. It's a message from the Gwaden. Requesting support. That's all it says. So are

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:23.080
all our mobile suits ready to sortie? Yes. But what about Camille, sir? The Gwaden is our first

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:28.840
priority. Be sure to inform the Radish as well. Yes, sir. Adjust missile targeting. Make sure to

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:29.760
avoid the Gwaden.

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:30.910
Launch missiles.

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:38.290
You ready? You're next.

00:14:38.470 --> 00:14:40.690
I can't. I can't go out.

00:14:40.990 --> 00:14:43.250
What are you talking about? You're on standby, aren't you?

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:45.760
If it means fighting for Zeon, I can't do it.

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:46.700
Something wrong.

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:48.480
Kotz is acting strangely, sir.

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:49.000
Again?

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:52.190
Captain, I've just received word from Camille.

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:53.580
Now what?

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:54.850
Are you okay?

00:14:55.110 --> 00:14:57.280
Of course I'm okay. I'm heading back.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.980
No, wait. Stay out there and go support the...

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.200
The Gwaden?

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:02.750
That Haman, Colin.

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:05.010
She betrayed us like Master Paptimus said.

00:15:05.310 --> 00:15:05.570
Huh?

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.080
I know that voice.

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:08.000
Roger that.

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:10.500
Camille, is it true you're actually helping Haman?

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:13.340
One day she's gonna betray the Ayuk, you know.

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:16.600
Just remember that it takes a thief to catch a thief.

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:19.720
It's Sarah.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:21.510
I know that it's her.

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:23.080
But how?

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:24.310
Who is it?

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:25.550
Whose voice was that?

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:26.450
Okay, Torres.

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:27.230
I'm going.

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:29.480
Are you all right, Kotz?

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.000
I'm fine.

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:33.000
Good, we're counting on you.

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:34.500
Why is she with Camille?

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:37.300
Methus launching.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:59.640
Aeug missiles are striking the gate of Zedan, ma'am.

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:01.620
They're just so honest.

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:05.020
That should keep them pinned down in the gate of Zedan.

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:08.170
But we still have to see how the Jupitress responds.

00:16:08.840 --> 00:16:10.540
Have our Gaza Cs stand by.

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:12.860
And remember, keep an eye on the Jupitress.

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:13.890
Yes, ma'am.

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:24.870
She's as clever as they come.

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:27.250
All mobile suits are now ready to launch, sir.

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:28.310
Very well, then.

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:38.340
It's the Violent, sir.

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.380
That's Lieutenant Jared's mobile suit.

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:43.250
Wow, Jared's out there.

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:50.430
Come on!

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:55.750
Demis are being taken out by an approaching mobile suit.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:57.580
Then send out our Gaza Seas.

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:59.040
Beam fire from dead ahead.

00:16:59.220 --> 00:16:59.820
Ignore it.

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:01.650
They aren't lucky enough to hit us.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.080
The Gwadon first.

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:09.420
We can take care of their mobile suits later.

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:10.000
Roger.

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:11.670
Out of my way!

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:20.970
The him again?

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:29.450
All units fan out and protect the Gwadon's flanks.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:31.940
The Ayook!

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:32.620
Huh?

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:33.500
The Zeta!

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:38.920
Jared!

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:40.900
Camille Bidon!

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:27.840
Grenades those things are homing weapons. We're lucky. Hold on to something Sarah. Why that?

00:18:30.350 --> 00:18:38.600
Jupitris, Serpoptimus.

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:42.680
There's Jared.

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:48.350
There he is.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:52.470
Sir, enemy mobile suits are surrounding the Guadon.

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:55.320
Tell our pilots they need to get closer to the Guadon,

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:56.580
and don't chase the enemy.

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:57.240
Yes, sir.

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:58.560
Are the mega cannons ready?

00:18:58.740 --> 00:18:59.200
Yes, sir.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.000
They're putting up more resistance than we expected.

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:05.800
Does this mean that Hamon's assassination attempt failed?

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:21.580
Wrong with you.

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.090
Get them with the anti-air.

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:29.980
Lieutenant Jared, we shouldn't pursue the...

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:42.100
any further we're in a crossfire just ignore it don't be a coward what are you doing i won't let

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:50.980
you interfere with my master ah no kameo

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:02.620
It's worth it if it helps Master Paptimus.

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:05.320
Sarah? Where are you, Sarah?

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:07.480
Camille? Answer me!

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:07.980
Kotz!

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:09.680
It's him.

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:16.520
It's not like you to run away, Camille!

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:18.320
What does it take to convince you?

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.460
Let's go, Sarah!

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:20.980
Kotz! Please help me!

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:21.820
Is that you, Sarah?

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:24.850
But Kotz, we're in the middle of a battle!

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:26.530
Kotz, listen to me!

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:27.640
Don't do this!

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:29.590
I'm fighting for Haman, please!

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:34.240
No, Sarah, I won't let you trick Kotz again.

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:37.140
You have to destroy the Gwarden Kotz. Do you hear me?

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:39.280
Do you want to be Scirocco's slave?

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:58.910
And now he took out my vernias!

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:01.620
I can't fight like this!

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:10.320
The enemies seem to be withdrawing.

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:12.600
Have they finally given up?

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:17.690
That's enough.

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:19.240
It's over.

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:26.460
Neil, is she...

00:21:26.460 --> 00:21:27.580
Is Sarah all right?

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:29.540
Yeah, she's just unconscious.

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:40.290
You're like a different person. You know, you're a lot tougher than you were before.

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:42.780
I owe it all to you, Sarah.

00:21:43.180 --> 00:21:43.360
Huh?

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:48.120
Once you've been hurt by dishonesty, it forces you to grow up.

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:52.800
It's good for you to become stronger, Kotz. Especially if you do it for the one you love.

00:21:53.420 --> 00:21:59.240
That's right, Sarah. That's why you've become as strong as you are now. And it's all for Shirako.

00:22:00.190 --> 00:22:05.880
Let him go. Why did you bring her here anyway? You knew this would happen.

00:22:06.160 --> 00:22:13.700
I just can't take lives in cold blood. Besides, there's gotta be a better way than just wiping everyone out, isn't there?

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:29.440
Sedan has closed its doors to Amon Khan, but Axis is relentlessly approaching with more than enough force to crack it open.

00:23:45.740 --> 00:23:50.300
Manipulated like pawns, the Aeyug and the Titans battle each other at Haman's whim.

00:23:50.700 --> 00:23:54.960
In the end, the only true victor will be Haman Khan.

00:23:55.560 --> 00:23:59.960
Jarrett's cries and Rekawa's hopes are tragically powerless when the larger...

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:02.660
Force of Fate itself begins to come into play.

00:24:03.004 --> 00:24:05.324
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam.

00:24:05.724 --> 00:24:07.164
Coming from the heavens.

00:24:08.060 --> 00:24:10.120
You will see the tears of time.
